<title>USA: First Call in distribution deal with Cowen &amp; Co.</title>
<headline>First Call in distribution deal with Cowen &amp; Co.</headline>
<dateline>BOSTON 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Call Corp said Monday it has signed a distribution deal with Cowen &amp; Co to deliver the brokerage firm's research via First Call Research Direct.</p>
<p>Terms of the agreement were not disclosed.</p>
<p>((New York Newsdesk 212 859 1610))</p>
</text>
